# Placetas Truck Services website

This is a free, static website. It does not require a paid website builder, hosting subscription, database, or backend.

## Preview on your computer
1. Unzip the downloaded folder.
2. Open `index.html` in Chrome, Edge, or another browser.
3. Keep the `assets` folder beside `index.html`; it contains your supplied logo.

## Publish free with GitHub Pages
1. Create or sign in to a free account at https://github.com.
2. Create a new public repository named `placetas-truck-services`.
3. Upload `index.html`, `styles.css`, `script.js`, and the complete `assets` folder.
4. In the repository, open **Settings → Pages**.
5. Under **Build and deployment**, choose **Deploy from a branch**, select **main** and **/(root)**, then save.
6. GitHub will show your free website address after it publishes.

A free address will look similar to `https://YOUR-USERNAME.github.io/placetas-truck-services/`.
You can later connect a custom domain if you purchase one.

## Before publishing
- Confirm the email address and street address shown on the site.
- Add your shop phone number and business hours when you are ready.
- Review the service descriptions and remove any service you do not offer.
- The hero background is loaded from Unsplash; an internet connection is needed to display it. The rest of the site files are local.

The site is a starter design; it does not currently include online appointment booking or customer accounts.

